{"title":"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compute the largest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d23b6f717ba85ee1a4ae7a094310f9002d7c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2004^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3c47d07b2d07f9731fb8a26ed5472d07cfc1487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2004!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f23997c6c747eee670cf7a36a0e274f70f6d1f67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2004 = 2^2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 167$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />. We focus on the large prime <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa1fc71b09af19812c2d58f881973287e7f6469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$167$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> as the powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3c47d07b2d07f9731fb8a26ed5472d07cfc1487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2004!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> are going to be much higher. The largest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa1fc71b09af19812c2d58f881973287e7f6469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$167$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> that divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3c47d07b2d07f9731fb8a26ed5472d07cfc1487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2004!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f969a8305a89127e630c54b8542640bdb73ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{2004}{167} = \\boxed{012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"95\" height=\"26\" />, the answer. \n</p><p>-MP8148\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 Pre 20